/* {{ .Name }} 样式入口（主资源）：只负责按顺序装配主层与用户层，页面样式禁止写进 HTML 内联样式表。
   主层随 yd 升级由 `yd sync` 整份替换；用户层 `user.css` 永不覆盖，因此升级主资源不需要手工合并。
   {{ .Name }} style entry (main resource): it only assembles the main layer and the user layer in order;
   page styles must never live in inline HTML style sheets. The main layer follows yd upgrades and is
   replaced wholesale by `yd sync`; the user layer `user.css` is never overwritten, so upgrading the main
   resources needs no manual merge. */
{{- if .Tailwind }}
/* Tailwind v4 由 Go 脚手架静默编译（无 Node.js 管道），产物写入 {{ .AssetRoot }}/static/css/yd.css。 |
   Tailwind v4 is compiled silently by the Go toolchain (no Node.js pipeline) into {{ .AssetRoot }}/static/css/yd.css.

   关闭自动源探测：yd-main.css 里的 @source 是唯一扫描范围，项目依赖与图标数据不会污染产物。 |
   Disable automatic source detection: the @source lines in yd-main.css are the only scan roots, so project
   dependencies and icon data cannot pollute the generated stylesheet. */
@import "tailwindcss" source(none);
{{- end }}

/* 主资源层：组件层、主题令牌与全部框架规则。它先于用户层导入，因此用户规则可以在后面覆盖它。
   Main resource layer: component layers, theme tokens and every framework rule. It is imported before
   the user layer, so user rules can override it below. */
@import "./yd-main.css";

/* 用户资源层：项目自有，`yd sync` 永不覆盖。把主题覆盖、组件微调与额外规则写在这里。
   User resource layer: owned by the project and never overwritten by `yd sync`. Put theme overrides,
   component tweaks and additional rules here. */
@import "./user.css";